### reviews.rest — Reseñas y reputación
### Módulo: src/reviews/reviews.controller.ts (ReviewsModule)
### listForListing/listForUser/reputation son PÚBLICOS. myReviewable/create
### requieren JWT. Solo se puede reseñar una reserva COMPLETED y pagada.
###
### Elegí entorno con "Switch Environment" (local/production). Ver REST_CLIENT.md.
### Mantenimiento: si cambia este endpoint, actualizá este archivo en el mismo
### cambio (ver CLAUDE.md).

### ── Setup: ciclo completo de reserva hasta COMPLETED (ver bookings.rest) ───

@ownerEmail = review-owner-{{$timestamp}}@test.local
@renterEmail = review-renter-{{$timestamp}}@test.local
@password = TestPass123!
@ownerCode = 000000
@renterCode = 000000

# @name ownerRegisterStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/start
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "email": "{{ownerEmail}}" }

### ⚠️ Copiá el código del owner de la consola del server antes de seguir.
# @name ownerRegisterComplete
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/complete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{ownerEmail}}",
  "code": "{{ownerCode}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "firstName": "Carla",
  "lastName": "Owner",
  "acceptedTerms": true,
  "dateOfBirth": "1992-07-15"
}

@ownerToken = {{ownerRegisterComplete.response.body.$.accessToken}}
@ownerUserId = {{ownerRegisterComplete.response.body.$.user.id}}

# @name renterRegisterStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/start
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "email": "{{renterEmail}}" }

### ⚠️ Copiá el código del renter de la consola del server antes de seguir.
# @name renterRegisterComplete
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/complete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{renterEmail}}",
  "code": "{{renterCode}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "firstName": "Bruno",
  "lastName": "Renter",
  "acceptedTerms": true,
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-03-10"
}

@renterToken = {{renterRegisterComplete.response.body.$.accessToken}}
@renterUserId = {{renterRegisterComplete.response.body.$.user.id}}

### Owner y renter necesitan cuenta VERIFIED (ver verification.rest / admin.rest).

# @name createVehicle
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{ "brand": "Toyota", "model": "Corolla", "year": 2021, "category": "SEDAN" }

@vehicleId = {{createVehicle.response.body.$.id}}

# @name createListing
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "title": "Toyota Corolla 2021",
  "description": "Auto full equipo, service al día, ideal para viajes largos.",
  "pricePerDay": 15000,
  "locationText": "Av. Corrientes 1234, CABA",
  "latitude": -34.6037,
  "longitude": -58.3816,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

@listingId = {{createListing.response.body.$.id}}

# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

{
  "listingId": "{{listingId}}",
  "startDate": "2026-09-10",
  "endDate": "2026-09-15"
}

@bookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}

# @name acceptBooking
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

@pickupToken = {{acceptBooking.response.body.$.pickupQrToken}}
@returnToken = {{acceptBooking.response.body.$.returnQrToken}}

# @name payBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/bookings/{{bookingId}}/mock-confirm
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

{}

# @name readyForPickup
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/ready-for-pickup
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

# @name confirmPickup
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/confirm-pickup
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{ "token": "{{pickupToken}}" }

# @name confirmReturn
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/confirm-return
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

{ "token": "{{returnToken}}" }

### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Reseñas de una publicación (público — se muestran en el detalle del auto).
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/{{listingId}}/reviews

### 2. Reseñas recibidas por una persona (público — se muestran en su perfil).
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{ownerUserId}}/reviews

### 3. Reputación separada por rol (conductor / dueño).
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{ownerUserId}}/reputation

### 4. Qué reservas propias se pueden reseñar y cuáles ya se reseñaron.
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/me/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

### 5. El renter reseña al owner (reserva ya COMPLETED y pagada).
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/reviews
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excelente atención, el auto estaba impecable y a tiempo."
}

### 6. El owner reseña al renter.
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/reviews
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "rating": 4,
  "comment": "Buen inquilino, devolvió el auto en horario y en buen estado."
}
